# Cloudflare Pages headers for docs.wheelofheaven.world
#
# Zola copies static/ to the output root, where Pages reads this file —
# the same arrangement www uses (www/static/_headers).
#
# Keep comments OUTSIDE the rule blocks. Every indented line under a path
# is parsed as `name: value`, so an indented `#` is not obviously safe,
# and these blocks carry the CSP — not the place to find out.

# RFC 9727 catalog advertisement. Until now only www sent this, so an
# agent that entered the project through the documentation had no path to
# the catalog, the auth policy or the MCP server.
#
# Absolute URL, unlike www's copy: the catalog document is centralised on
# www (one copy, so it cannot drift), and a relative `/.well-known/…` here
# would resolve against this host, where it 404s. The catalog sends
# `Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *`, so cross-origin agents can follow it.
#
# Security headers mirror www's set, minus two deliberate differences.
#
# `img-src` and `font-src` are `'self'` only: this site is entirely
# self-hosted. Every request from the homepage, /architecture/,
# /components/, /reference/icons/ and a Mermaid-bearing page goes to this
# origin and nowhere else — verified by recording network traffic, because
# the source tree *mentions* cdn.jsdelivr.net, fonts.googleapis.com and
# registry.npmjs.org, all of them inside vendored bundles and lockfiles
# rather than anything the browser fetches.
#
# No `'unsafe-eval'`, even though Mermaid renders here: the vendored
# mermaid.min.js contains no `new Function(` and no bare `eval(`, so the
# same `script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'` www uses is enough. It needs
# `style-src 'unsafe-inline'` for the styles it injects into diagram SVG.
#
# No HSTS: it belongs on the apex, which currently serves no HSTS at all
# and only 301s to www. Adding it per-subdomain here would be cargo cult —
# see the note in www/static/_headers about the `preload` token.
/*
  Link: <https://www.wheelofheaven.world/.well-known/api-catalog>; rel="api-catalog"
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), magnetometer=(), gyroscope=(), accelerometer=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; media-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'
